    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19325" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαπτ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dipped, dyed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.30
			</span></i>; <i>bright-coloured,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					287
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					530
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βάπτ᾽ ἔχοντες</span>
			<i>dyed,</i> i.e. <i>black,</i> garments, <i><span class="en">
				Hegesipp.
				1.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>for dyeing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					847c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of water,
				<i>drawn by dipping vessels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				123
			</span></i> (lyr.).</div>
